{"id":663,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Talonflame dives toward prey at speeds of up to 310 mph and assaults them with powerful kicks, giving the prey no chance to escape."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Talonflame mainly preys upon other bird Pokémon. To intimidate opponents, it sends embers spewing from gaps between its feathers."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Bird Pokémon make up most of its diet. It approaches at high speeds and smacks them down to the ground with its powerful kick."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Its tough wings don’t allow fire to pass through them. A long time ago, firefighters’ outfits were made from Talonflame wings."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It zooms directly at its prey at flight speeds of close to 310 mph, while fiery embers scatter from gaps in its feathers."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its favorite foods are Wingull and Pikipek. It attacks with a powerful kick and grasps them firmly in its talons."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"When attacking prey, it can reach speeds of up to 310 mph. It finishes its prey off with a colossal kick."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"In the fever of an exciting battle, it showers embers from the gaps between its feathers and takes to the air."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Flame Body","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may burn the attacker."},{"name":"Gale Wings","hidden":true,"description":"Gives priority to the Pokémon's Flying-type moves while its HP is full."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Red","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":661,"name":"Fletchling","condition":null,"children":[{"id":662,"name":"Fletchinder","condition":"Lv. 17","children":[{"id":663,"name":"Talonflame","condition":"Lv. 35","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,45],[1,52],[1,64],[1,98],[1,364],[1,394],[1,488],[15,175],[22,512],[29,97],[38,332],[47,366],[56,211],[65,355],